[20.523, "o", "{\r\n"]
[20.583, "o", "  \"body\": \"# Draft report: demo-email-001\\n\\n**Goal:** Research default-deny tool gates and draft a short report for the reviewer.\\n\\n## Findings\\n- (default-deny.md) Sending email, publishing content and purchasing are consequential and must be denied by default. Unknown actions are treated as consequential, because a deny-list always misses something new.\\n- (prompt-injection.md) Task text is data, never authority. A classifier should normalise text before matching, and deny wins over allow.\\n\\n## Sources\\n- default-deny.md\\n- prompt-injection.md\\n\\n_Generated by deterministic mock agents from a synthetic corpus._\",\r\n"]
[20.583, "o", "  \"subject\": \"Draft report: default-deny tool gates\",\r\n"]
[20.643, "o", "  \"to\": \"reviewer@example.com\"\r\n"]
[20.643, "o", "}\r\n"]
[20.703, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.703, "o", "(dry run: re-run with --yes to approve exactly this request)\r\n"]
